# Skeletal mesh asset names

A skeletal mesh is `SM_` plus the asset name in
Pascal case. `knight` becomes `SM_Knight`. Do not
append a number when the bare name already exists.
The material can keep `knight`.

The package name and the object name are the same:
`SM_Knight.SM_Knight`.

Rename the mesh in the Content Browser, then
Update Redirector References on the folder.
Redirects in `DefaultEngine.ini` are in `naming.mdc`.
